# Stilwell Farms town: the farm road enters at the top (x=15..16).
# North row: blacksmith, general store, cafe, carpenter on Main Street; town hall heads the plaza;
# realtor + houses on the side lanes; park along the south street. Borders are forest.
# Market Street (rows 21-31, invest.c): through the gate south of the park, closed (main.c walkable)
# until you buy it at the Land Office. Four lots for businesses you build, four community sites.
map TOWN set=TOWN w=32 h=32 music=TOWN
key F FOREST block
key . GRASS walk
key , GRASS2 walk
key * WILDFLOWER walk
key = DIRT walk
key c COBBLE walk
key u BUNTING walk
key p PATH walk
key T TOWN_TREE block
key f FLOWERBED block
key o FLOWERPOT block
key l TOWN_LAMP block
